Fresh reconstruction is using only copied source; no candidate compiled definition or cache has been reused. Both LLVM and Haskell definitions compile cleanly enough to execute, the concrete K run reproduces all six boundary/example outputs with normal termination, and the full positive spec plus the standalone loop invariant each close with `#Top`. I’m checking the entry claim’s dependence on the loop circularity before moving to the static gate.
